/E (Sonification is the process of translating data into sound, it offers a powerful way to bridge this gap. Converting visual elements into audio unlocks multi-sensory ways to experience Earth data. Auditory processing can reveal subtle data patterns that might be missed by the naked eye and can foster a deeper emotional connection to our home planet. Participants might prioritize creating an interactive environment where the translation from sight to sound is exploratory, blending scientific data with artistic expression.)
