/P 77 0 R
/E (As you build your project, you may consider exploring a variety of methods and technologies to process the visual data. You might use computer vision techniques to analyze color palettes, shapes, or pixel densities in the EIC imagery, and map those elements to audio parameters like pitch, tempo, or instrumentation. You are welcome to employ machine learning algorithms, open-source audio synthesis frameworks, or custom data-driven artistic rulesets to generate the soundscapes. The exact method of translation is entirely up to you, we encourage you to aim for soundscapes that balance data interpretation with artistic, musically pleasing outputs.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
